Here is a tentative schedule of activities for jbonunsla this weekend.

As a reminder, jbonunsla is being held at the Holiday Inn in Princeton, New=
 Jersey, the weekend of August 29-30. There will likely be impromptu activi=
ties Friday through Sunday evening, in addition to the ones scheduled here.

Those who can't join by person in New Jersey are encouraged to take part in=
 IRC sessions on Saturday afternoon (1pm EDT / 17:00 UTC) and evening (5pm =
EDT / 21:00 UTC) and/or a VOIP chat on Sunday morning (11am EDT / 15:00 UTC=
).

Please feel free to reach out with questions or to suggest additional activ=
ities in the Lojban Google Group / mailing list:=20

https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/lojban <https://groups.google.com/f=
orum/#!forum/lojban>

Friday, August 28

3:00 PM EDT
Check-in begins (Holiday Inn)

=E2=80=94=20

Saturday, August 29

9:00 AM EDT
Opening ceremonies: Jbonunsla 2015
=E2=80=9CRome=E2=80=9D Meeting Room, Holiday Inn, Princeton

Readings and songs. Attendees are invited to present original works, or tra=
nslations, and to bring a musical instrument.

** lunch/brunch/dormijysai **

1:00 PM - 5:00 PM EDT
CLL Edit-a-thon

Robin Lee Powell will join from San Francisco via #lojban in IRC <https://k=
iwiirc.com/client/irc.freenode.net/?#jbosnu,#ckule,#lojban> (freenode.net) =
to coordinate work on the forthcoming reissue of "The Complete Lojban Langu=
age".

5:00 PM - 6:00 PM EDT (21:00 - 22:00 UTC)
Founders chat

lojbab and possibly Nora will join from Virginia via #lojban in IRC <https:=
//kiwiirc.com/client/irc.freenode.net/?#jbosnu,#ckule,#lojban> (freenode.ne=
t)

=E2=80=94=20

Sunday, August 30

11:00 AM - 1:00 PM EDT (15:00 - 17:00 UTC)
International VOIP chat

Lojbanists from around the world will assemble by Mumble <http://wiki.mumbl=
e.info/wiki/Main_Page> (connect to http://mumble.metal-bunker.info:64738) t=
o chat with attendees.

** lunch/brunch/dormijysai **

2:00 PM - 4:00 PM EDT
nooLearn Game
=E2=80=9CRome=E2=80=9D Meeting Room, Holiday Inn, Princeton

Brian Wernham of nooLearn will guide attendees in a Lojban learning game, w=
ith prizes for participation.

6:00 PM EDT
Closing ceremonies: Jbonunsla 2015
=E2=80=9CRome=E2=80=9D Meeting Room, Holiday Inn, Princeton

=E2=80=94=20

Monday, August 31

12:00 PM (Noon) EDT
Check-out (Holiday Inn)

